-module-11\" data-csa-c-id=\"alm4am-h7ddrm-nhayqu-c8fy4t\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-11\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Cyberpunk 2077 Ultimate Edition Nintendo Switch 2 video game\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/8a08779d-60cc-4438-b56f-df3afa24ea53.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/8a08779d-60cc-4438-b56f-df3afa24ea53.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-11 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-11\" data-csa-c-id=\"5o8a1n-qohvf5-uecaib-vzw54x\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-11\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Cyberpunk 2077 Ultimate Edition Nintendo Switch 2 video game\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/a69ef7b0-020f-4fa4-817a-9283f2b76f2f.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/a69ef7b0-020f-4fa4-817a-9283f2b76f2f.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-11 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-11\" data-csa-c-id=\"hsz7k-1zcvf8-2inhsv-60y9fb\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-11\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Cyberpunk 2077 Ultimate Edition Nintendo Switch 2 video game\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ae0d2cfb-dc8c-4baf-9dd7-03027bf1f807.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ae0d2cfb-dc8c-4baf-9dd7-03027bf1f807.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46999019487454,"sku":"","price":60.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_b405317e-2973-44b8-b946-183b7d8ae73d.jpg?v=1749322017"},{"product_id":"hogwarts-legacy-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Hogwarts Legacy - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis edition of Hogwarts Legacy has been enhanced for Nintendo Switch 2, including Joy-Con 2 mouse sensor support, improved graphics, audio, load times, and controls. Hogwarts Legacy is an immersive, open-world action RPG set in the world first introduced in the Harry Potter books. Take control of the action and be at the center of your own adventure in the wizarding world. Experience Hogwarts in the 1800s. Make allies, battle Dark wizards, and ultimately decide the fate of the wizarding world. Your legacy is what you make of it. Live the Unwritten. EXPLORE AN OPEN WORLD: The wizarding world awaits you. Freely roam Hogwarts, Hogsmeade, the Forbidden Forest, and the surrounding Overland area. BE THE WITCH OR WIZARD YOU WANT TO BE: Learn spells, brew potions, grow plants, and tend to magical beasts along your journey. Get sorted into your house, forge relationships, and master skills to become the witch or wizard you want to be. EXPERIENCE A NEW WIZARDING WORLD STORY: Experience the wizarding world in a forgotten era to uncover a hidden truth from its past. Battle against trolls, dark wizards, and more as you face a dangerous villain threatening the fate of the wizarding world.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"WB Games","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46999022141662,"sku":"","price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_b68e431b-84ed-4b67-929f-ce3f137e2bb7.jpg?v=1749322340"},{"product_id":"sonic-x-shadow-generations-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Sonic X Shadow Generations - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-7-card1\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\" data-template-name=\"productDescription\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_fullView\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section text-direction-override\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSONIC AND SHADOW FOR A NEW GENERATION: Shadow the Hedgehog is back with Classic and Modern Sonic in SONIC X SHADOW GENERATIONS, an all-new collection featuring two unique experiences, enahnced and optimized for the Nintendo Switch 2!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-7-card2\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" data-template-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small featureBulletsDiv\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePast meets present in SONIC GENERATIONS! Modern and Classic Sonic team up to defeat Dr. Eggman and the Time Eater to restore their timeline to normal!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSpin dash through a greatest-hits collection of 3D and 2D versions of iconic stages from past Sonic games, now with updated visuals and reworked cinematics\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eIn this new standalone campaign, Black Doom has reemerged and threatens to take over the world. Shadow must journey into his past, confront his memories, and unlock new dark powers to save the world.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eHarness Shadow's new Doom Powers to battle hordes of enemies and tackle platforming challenges like never before. Surf on water, fly over obstacles, and stop time with the return of Chaos Control!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePre-order bonus: Customers who pre-order will receive the Sonic Adventure Legacy Skin and Gerald Robotnik's Journal, a 28-page logbook chronicling Gerald's innermost thoughts and drawings while he created Shadow the Hedgehog and the Ark Space Station.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"SEGA","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46999047897310,"sku":"","price":38.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_508ef52a-4e25-403b-a774-e231d0a28ebb.jpg?v=1749322972"},{"product_id":"mario-kart-world-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Mario Kart World - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47007023038686,"sku":"","price":65.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_0501ed86-09e6-47df-8106-23a40b06141f.jpg?v=1749648759"},{"product_id":"the-legend-of-zelda-breath-of-the-wild-nintendo-switch-2-edition","title":"The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild - Nintendo Switch 2 Edition","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-2-card1\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\" data-template-name=\"productDescription\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_fullView\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section text-direction-override\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild – Nintendo Switch 2 Edition\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUpgrade details\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSupport for the ZELDA NOTES game-specific service via Nintendo Switch App\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eImproved frame rates and resolution\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFaster load times\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHDR support\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNintendo Account, persistent internet and compatible smart device required. Data charges may apply.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHDR-compatible display required when playing in TV mode.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-2-card2\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" data-template-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u0