do Switch App\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eImproved frame rates and resolution\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFaster load times\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHDR support\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNintendo Account, persistent internet and compatible smart device required. Data charges may apply.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHDR-compatible display required when playing in TV mode.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-2-card2\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" data-template-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small featureBulletsDiv\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom – Nintendo Switch 2 Edition\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eUpgrade details\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSupport for the ZELDA NOTES game-specific service via Nintendo Switch App; improved frame rates and resolution\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFaster load times; HDR support\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eNintendo Account, persistent internet and compatible smart device required; data charges may apply; HDR-compatible display required when playing in TV mode\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47008099795166,"sku":"","price":60.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_3e08c108-d4a0-4f5e-a7a4-fa505c7dd0d0.jpg?v=1749676570"},{"product_id":"street-fighter-6-years-1-2-fighters-edition-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Street Fighter 6 - Years 1-2 - Fighters Edition - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"flex text-body-40 text-grey-900\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience the next evolution of Street Fighter in Street Fighter 6 with three distinct game modes, new gameplay features, and enhanced visuals.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex text-body-40 text-grey-900\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"rounded-full min-w-[5px] min-h-[5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-blue-400 mr-2 mt-2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFight your way to the top with new game modes exclusive to Nintendo Switch 2 like Local Wireless One on One and Avatar Matches. Enjoy new party modes utilising Joy-Con 2 controllers like Gyro Battle and Calorie Contest.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex text-body-40 text-grey-900\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"rounded-full min-w-[5px] min-h-[5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-blue-400 mr-2 mt-2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlus, players can check out three new amiibo figures and 22 amiibo cards at launch (sold seperatley)\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex text-body-40 text-grey-900\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"rounded-full min-w-[5px] min-h-[5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-blue-400 mr-2 mt-2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDigital Download File size\/s: 50GB Additional storage may be needed on your console for installation or software updates.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47038651236574,"sku":"","price":55.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_fe946403-d862-47b3-bc47-7878c53ba999.jpg?v=1750969242"},{"product_id":"donkey-kong-bananza-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Donkey Kong Bananza - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExplore a vast underground world—by smashing your way through it!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eA brand-new 3D platforming action adventure starring Donkey Kong and Pauline\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eBash through just about anything in groundbreaking exploration! Crash through walls and carve tunnels—the more you smash, the more areas open up to you\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePair up with Pauline to use Bananza Transformations: smash through obstacles with the raw strength of Kong form, gallop with incredible speed as a Zebra, and more\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eTeam up with a friend in two-player co-op as Donkey Kong and Pauline! Blast foes and terrain alike with Pauline’s voice as you explore together\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eRace against Void Kong, leader of the greedy VoidCo, to get to the bananas at the planet core\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eInterested in the Donkey Kong Bananza game?! Save* up to $29.99 on a Nintendo Switch 2 system bundled with your choice of a full game download for one of the following games exclusive to Nintendo Switch 2: Mario Kart World, Donkey Kong Bananza, or Pokémon Pokopia!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47113112682718,"sku":null,"price":60.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_f2b87326-5a14-48b7-bd05-6f43d9989a81.jpg?v=1753203025"},{"product_id":"super-mario-party-jamboree-nintendo-switch-2-edition-jamboree-tv","title":"Super Mario Party Jamboree - Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + Jamboree TV","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-2-card1\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\" data-template-name=\"productDescription\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_fullView\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section text-direction-override\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe biggest Mario party - together, whenever and wherever you want!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDiscover unique new modes and mini-games that use mouse mode, the microphone built into the console, and the Nintendo Switch 2 camera (sold separately).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInvite friends to the Bowser stage, a game show experience with 2v2 team battles!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-2-card2\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" data-template-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small featureBulletsDiv\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eDice and hang the others on the board to collect the most stars. Each of the seven game boards offers its very own world! New rules for Jamboree TV offer about 2-vs.-2 team matches and more\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eBowser asks for the super show - with you as stage stars! Two teams compete against each other in a series of fun mini-games controlled by sound and movement\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExperience 20 new mini games with the mouse mode of the Joy-Con 2, HD Vibration 2 and the microphone integrated in the console\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSome mini games can also be used with a compatible USB-C camera (sold separately). Experience the feeling as if you are all playing in the same room, even if you are far away from each other\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eGames Super Mario Party Jamboree with improved graphics and frame rate on Nintendo Switch 2\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47456701317342,"sku":null,"price":60.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/c