\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-5-card2\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\" data-template-name=\"productDescription\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_fullView\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section text-direction-override\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTHE ULTIMATE PUZZLE MATCH! Enter a newly enhanced dimension of puzzle challenge when the world-renowned Tetris and Japan's beloved Puyo Puyo series blend their legendary gameplay together!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"SEGA","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47456706199774,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_2388e150-86a0-49c1-9476-510352ba6ef1.jpg?v=1755552272"},{"product_id":"kirby-and-the-forgotten-land-nintendo-switch-2-edition-star-crossed-world","title":"Kirby and the Forgotten Land - Nintendo Switch  2 Edition + Star-Crossed World","description":"","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47493499945182,"sku":null,"price":60.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_a89cf0a0-0bf9-4361-a1b3-5311ae728729.jpg?v=1756792236"},{"product_id":"nba-2k26-nintendo-switch-2","title":"NBA 2K26 - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-3-card1\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"aplus_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"aplus\" data-template-name=\"aplus\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-n